:''For the Cat Unit, see [[Healer (Special Cat)]]. Not to be confused with [[Healer Cat]].''
'''Healer''' (癒術士 ''Yujutsushi'', '''Healer''')  is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Healer
|image = E 098.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,400¢ - 5,530¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is comparable to an [[R.Ost]] in terms of behavior, having high speed, relatively low damage and a somewhat fast attack cycle as well as occasional [[Critical Hit]]s at a surprisingly high range.

==Strategy==
Because of Healer's rapid attacks and range, melee units generally have no hope of defeating him on their own. Units that outrange him like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]], [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bath Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]], [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Red Riding Mina]], and most [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] should all do well against Healer in most stages. Just remember to spam [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] and back them with other attackers to defeat the nasty peons that allow him to advance as those [[Critical Hit]]s are not to be trifled with at higher strength magnifications where even one can melt whatever it hits instantly.

